WEBVTT

00:02.140 --> 00:04.980
We can never forgive them.

00:05.440 --> 00:10.900
Give them Admonitions and turn them all into corpses.

00:10.900 --> 00:12.860
Is this the Lightless Realm?

00:20.660 --> 00:23.960
You all come back as ghosts even
though you chose to die yourselves.

00:24.580 --> 00:26.960
You really are idiots.

00:27.540 --> 00:30.960
The black of human grudges gone stagnant and sour.

00:30.960 --> 00:34.930
Now, another darkness is born.

00:45.730 --> 00:54.070
The ink on today's graffiti runs

00:54.070 --> 01:05.080
A bicycle that has been abandoned awaits someone's return

01:05.080 --> 01:16.050
When we realized, it was up for us to choose if our existence is a replica or not

01:16.050 --> 01:20.430
Where is our proof?

01:20.430 --> 01:25.520
It's mankinds nature to come together

01:25.520 --> 01:30.570
Our love and bonds are things we can trust

01:30.570 --> 01:35.360
My sins are to be doubted

01:35.360 --> 01:41.700
The light I saw when you first held out your right hand

01:45.080 --> 01:50.540
We really are

01:59.050 --> 02:01.260
The Dark Metal

02:05.480 --> 02:10.480
Episode 19
The Black Sunset

02:11.940 --> 02:13.020
An Admonition?

02:13.020 --> 02:14.110
It's huge.

02:14.110 --> 02:17.990
This must be the island folk's regrets.

02:17.990 --> 02:19.820
We don't have any Vesses here.

02:20.280 --> 02:22.160
Let's retreat for now!

02:22.160 --> 02:25.290
We'll escape the island with the carrier!

02:25.290 --> 02:26.410
Right!

02:27.830 --> 02:29.500
Minashi, hurry up!

02:34.250 --> 02:36.170
So that's how it is.

02:40.260 --> 02:43.140
You still don't understand?

02:43.640 --> 02:46.100
I'm keeping the promise I made back then—

02:46.100 --> 02:50.900
to achieve the goal of connecting ones thoughts to another person.

02:51.480 --> 02:54.440
You've helped enough with that.

02:54.440 --> 02:56.150
Isn't that something to celebrate?

02:56.730 --> 02:58.900
It's unreasonable to hold a grudge against me.

02:59.530 --> 03:02.320
If you think about it a little, you're sure to understand.

03:18.460 --> 03:21.380
So nothing I say can be understood by those good-for-nothings?

03:23.890 --> 03:27.100
If that's the case, then just stay quiet and die!

03:33.350 --> 03:39.190
Mimei, your companions here
can't seem to understand our dream.

03:39.190 --> 03:40.820
It's such a shame, isn't it?

03:49.290 --> 03:51.250
The carrier...

03:51.250 --> 03:52.580
No way.

03:52.580 --> 03:54.500
It's turned fully into Necrometal.

03:54.500 --> 03:55.500
The comm link!

03:55.500 --> 03:56.750
It's useless now.

03:59.460 --> 04:02.510
We need to think of another way.

04:02.510 --> 04:04.340
Where's Minashi?

04:06.260 --> 04:07.890
When the hell...

04:32.080 --> 04:34.170
It's useless, utterly useless.

04:34.170 --> 04:37.500
This machine isn't piloted just by one person.

04:38.170 --> 04:41.170
Its brain is very special.

04:41.170 --> 04:44.220
That is why I held on to it this whole time.

04:44.760 --> 04:46.430
Right, Mimei?

05:00.110 --> 05:04.070
That lab is a cluster of regrets.

05:04.070 --> 05:07.320
Well, I guess it's optimal for drawing out the spirits.

05:07.320 --> 05:09.030
But is that really good idea?

05:17.790 --> 05:21.670
Seriously, good-for-nothings are always like this.

05:21.670 --> 05:24.920
Always high-handed when they think we're powerless.

05:24.920 --> 05:27.970
...each other's consciousness...

05:27.970 --> 05:29.970
What a load of crap.

05:30.430 --> 05:31.970
Complete waste of time.

05:31.970 --> 05:34.980
One application is this resonance...

05:34.980 --> 05:36.190
Cancel it!

05:36.190 --> 05:40.150
The resonance research has almost borne fruit!

05:40.150 --> 05:41.900
It's already been decided.

05:41.900 --> 05:44.070
This experiment facility will be disposed of.

05:44.530 --> 05:46.320
Damned good-for-nothings...

05:46.320 --> 05:49.780
How much must I suffer before they are satisfied?

05:50.490 --> 05:52.330
That's fine by me.

05:52.330 --> 05:54.000
I'll make you all pay!

05:56.370 --> 05:58.120
It's as I expected.

05:58.120 --> 06:01.250
That room still hasn't turned into Necrometal—

06:01.840 --> 06:05.720
the very same experiment room that made you all suffer!

06:06.260 --> 06:11.510
What's going to happen if I turn the power on?

06:14.970 --> 06:17.770
I told you so!

06:17.770 --> 06:20.480
Of all things, you picked the lab to take in.

06:21.310 --> 06:23.940
Stop it...

06:23.940 --> 06:25.650
What's wrong?

06:25.650 --> 06:29.570
Did the lab bring back all the bad memories that you experienced?

06:29.570 --> 06:34.790
It's because you took in the
resonance experiment pod as well.

06:34.790 --> 06:37.250
How hilarious.

06:37.250 --> 06:43.960
You yourselves took in the object of your nightmares and now tremble from the terror it gives you.

06:43.960 --> 06:45.590
You're all pretty stupid, aren't you?

06:50.510 --> 06:54.560
Maybe it'll crumble all on its own now.

06:54.560 --> 06:57.020
Won't this be fun, Mimei?

07:17.870 --> 07:19.330
It's withered, after all.

07:41.640 --> 07:42.850
What's this?

07:45.440 --> 07:48.780
Faint remnants of the Arbornine's memory?

07:49.740 --> 07:52.110
The guys from IX came all the way here.

07:54.240 --> 07:55.910
Why did something like this happen?

07:56.620 --> 07:59.910
What in the world did you want to do, Big Sister?

08:01.160 --> 08:04.380
I'm sure he'll make it a reality—

08:04.380 --> 08:07.420
a world where the hearts of everyone are connected.

08:08.250 --> 08:12.010
When he does, we won't have to
live in hiding on this island anymore.

08:12.720 --> 08:15.260
Everyone will be happy.

08:22.310 --> 08:23.690
That's right.

08:23.690 --> 08:26.980
That's the only way for everyone to be happy.

08:26.980 --> 08:29.440
I can't repeat the tragedy.

08:29.440 --> 08:32.570
That's what you meant, right, Big Sister?

08:32.570 --> 08:33.530
Minashi.

08:37.280 --> 08:38.370
Akashi...

08:39.120 --> 08:40.950
What are you doing?

08:40.950 --> 08:43.790
We should get off this island with the others.

08:44.500 --> 08:45.290
This is...

08:45.790 --> 08:47.460
Why?

08:47.460 --> 08:49.880
I see... So you felt it.

08:53.090 --> 08:54.470
An Arbornine.

08:56.300 --> 08:58.140
You came to look for this?

08:59.640 --> 09:01.600
This one is withered as well...

09:01.600 --> 09:04.310
But it's not dead yet.

09:04.850 --> 09:08.770
I can tell that everyone's wishes are still living in this place.

09:09.610 --> 09:13.070
This was the island's sanctuary.

09:13.070 --> 09:17.410
Everyone gathered here at times to pray for the island's peace.

09:18.030 --> 09:19.740
Everyone was happy.

09:21.330 --> 09:24.250
We could be happy by connecting.

09:26.750 --> 09:29.340
Akashi, I understand it now.

09:30.250 --> 09:34.170
What my older sister was aiming for.

09:41.180 --> 09:43.060
It's about to crumble.

09:43.060 --> 09:43.890
Back up.

09:46.810 --> 09:47.690
What's wrong?

09:47.690 --> 09:49.940
Back up! Get back!

09:52.820 --> 09:53.610
I've got no choice...

10:07.960 --> 10:11.130
Serves you right! Serves you right! Serves you all right!

10:12.590 --> 10:14.840
They're all so pitiful.

10:14.840 --> 10:21.600
They couldn't understand how useful they were as my experimental samples even in the end.

10:27.600 --> 10:29.020
This is...

10:29.770 --> 10:32.230
I'm turning into Necrometal?

10:44.910 --> 10:46.580
I can't get through.

10:46.580 --> 10:48.160
We're out of cell range too.

10:48.620 --> 10:51.880
Not a single report and Natsuiri isn't here either.

10:51.880 --> 10:53.420
What's happening on that island?

10:54.380 --> 10:55.300
Kasane...

10:58.130 --> 11:00.550
Aoshi?

11:10.690 --> 11:15.440
As I thought, the Necrometal
portion has heightened nerves.

11:15.440 --> 11:20.110
The hypotheses derived from my research were correct after all!

11:20.650 --> 11:22.620
However...

11:23.910 --> 11:28.750
However, I am gathering even
more data through this experience.

11:29.200 --> 11:36.840
It burned at first when my sleeve brushed it,
but over time it has evolved into some form of ecstasy.

11:36.840 --> 11:43.430
It's so obvious if thought of as an aggregate of nerves, but even I couldn't forsee this.

11:43.430 --> 11:45.300
I'm disappointed in myself.

11:45.930 --> 11:49.810
And I feel I've moved on to the next stage now.

11:50.480 --> 11:55.860
Like the boundary between
inside and out is fading gradually.

11:55.860 --> 11:58.900
A sensation of defenseless connection.

11:58.900 --> 12:05.660
If I control the spread of Necrometal using the LIM theory, your dream will become reality.

12:05.660 --> 12:07.160
I see.

12:07.160 --> 12:08.200
That is very strange.

12:08.200 --> 12:11.120
I should be able to connect with you now.

12:11.120 --> 12:12.330
What's wrong?

12:12.330 --> 12:13.330
What are you doing?

12:13.330 --> 12:16.340
Connect your thoughts with me, Mimei!

12:16.340 --> 12:17.800
Mimei!

12:17.800 --> 12:20.300
Mimei, can't you hear me?

12:20.300 --> 12:22.260
Answer me!

12:22.260 --> 12:23.880
Hey, Mimei?

12:25.180 --> 12:26.640
It can't be...

12:26.640 --> 12:28.510
No, there's no way.

12:28.510 --> 12:29.770
You wouldn't die!

12:29.770 --> 12:31.310
There's no way you would!

12:31.310 --> 12:33.940
In this module, Mimei was...

12:33.940 --> 12:38.320
Mimei was copied fully into this,
from her personality to her thought patterns!

12:46.660 --> 12:48.780
I don't think that's a good idea.

12:49.910 --> 12:53.210
Look at this data!

12:53.210 --> 12:55.080
I'm sure of it. It's resonance!

12:56.210 --> 12:58.630
Don't look away and spill your food.

13:02.550 --> 13:04.550
Mimei, it's a success...

13:04.550 --> 13:05.590
We did it...

13:06.680 --> 13:07.800
Damn...

13:07.800 --> 13:09.140
It's all right.

13:09.140 --> 13:12.100
They'll surely recognize your research.

13:12.850 --> 13:14.850
Mimei, I did it!

13:14.850 --> 13:17.060
My research was recognized!

13:17.060 --> 13:18.110
Really?

13:18.110 --> 13:19.230
Yeah.

13:19.230 --> 13:20.480
By IX!

13:20.480 --> 13:22.320
It was an offer from the IX Corporation!

13:22.320 --> 13:23.360
Congratulations!

13:24.950 --> 13:26.240
Mimei...

13:29.490 --> 13:35.830
If I copy everything about you, you'll become eternal, and then you can resonate with me anytime.

13:43.340 --> 13:45.220
I see...

13:49.220 --> 13:55.730
With the technology I had back then, I couldn't completely copy Mimei...

13:55.730 --> 13:57.770
So Mimei is gone.

13:58.230 --> 14:00.770
She's dead...

14:01.520 --> 14:06.360
If I'd known about the Necrometal
phenomenon then, I would've turned her into a LIM!

14:06.360 --> 14:12.910
Then she'd be that kind Mimei now,
and I could've connected to her in this Vess!

14:12.910 --> 14:15.580
Mimei would've been happier!

14:15.580 --> 14:16.910
Wouldn't you, Mimei?

14:17.330 --> 14:19.880
Mimei! Mimei! Mimei! Mimei!

14:22.840 --> 14:25.340
Everyone wants to be connected.

14:26.050 --> 14:29.180
That's why everyone should be.

14:29.180 --> 14:32.810
That was the world my sister wished for.

14:33.310 --> 14:36.480
That way my feelings wouldn't be misunderstood.

14:36.480 --> 14:38.310
Sasame, Tsugumi...

14:38.310 --> 14:40.690
Even you wouldn't have suffered.

14:41.270 --> 14:44.070
This isn't the time for that kind of talk.

14:44.070 --> 14:44.650
Let's go.

14:44.650 --> 14:46.650
Don't run away, scumbag!

14:47.610 --> 14:48.320
What?

14:48.740 --> 14:51.740
Unable to protect anything or save anyone...

14:51.740 --> 14:54.030
A scumbag always being protected...

14:54.870 --> 14:58.750
When you were saying that about yourself, I heard you.

15:00.960 --> 15:03.960
The one you always want to protect is you.

15:04.380 --> 15:08.340
You deny anyone from connecting to
you since you want to protect yourself.

15:08.800 --> 15:09.590
Right?

15:10.510 --> 15:12.180
What're you getting at?

15:21.100 --> 15:22.560
Stop it!

15:22.560 --> 15:26.230
You're still trembling and closing off your heart.

15:26.230 --> 15:27.940
You really are a coward.

15:28.610 --> 15:32.450
Sasame first thought it'd be better to be connected,

15:32.450 --> 15:36.830
but she became afraid of it since meeting you.

15:36.830 --> 15:38.250
It's a pity.

15:38.250 --> 15:41.540
Don't talk about Sasame's feelings just like that.

15:42.500 --> 15:46.420
Do you know how I feel when we're like this?

15:47.710 --> 15:48.840
I don't.

15:50.470 --> 15:51.180
Yeah.

15:53.010 --> 15:55.720
You're the one who doesn't understand her.

15:56.390 --> 16:00.100
Being connected can make everyone happy.

16:00.100 --> 16:01.140
Akashi!

16:01.140 --> 16:02.060
Minashi!

16:02.640 --> 16:04.980
Did we somehow connect with Iwato and the others?

16:04.980 --> 16:07.360
I marked the way.

16:07.360 --> 16:08.400
Oh!

16:08.400 --> 16:10.110
Akashi?

16:10.110 --> 16:11.570
Let's go.

16:11.570 --> 16:13.450
Iwato! Raika!

16:13.450 --> 16:14.780
We're over here!

16:20.290 --> 16:24.750
Your sacrifice guided my way to discovering LIM theory.

16:24.750 --> 16:28.090
But to think you weren't around then...

16:28.090 --> 16:30.050
Listen, Mimei.

16:30.050 --> 16:33.220
There's one thing I realized about the LIM theory.

16:33.630 --> 16:38.470
What makes the resonance between MA-Vess pilot and LIM stronger

16:38.470 --> 16:42.140
was the intimacy and compatibility between the two.

16:43.440 --> 16:46.770
It was such a simple thing.

16:46.770 --> 16:49.570
That's right. It was love.

16:49.570 --> 16:55.110
To think that such words are coming out of my mouth tickles me so...

16:55.110 --> 17:00.580
Mimei, you were the only one
in this world who accepted me.

17:03.040 --> 17:06.460
So your new research will start here?

17:06.460 --> 17:08.880
The whole island has high hopes too.

17:08.880 --> 17:10.590
High hopes, huh?

17:10.590 --> 17:14.800
Nobody has ever said that about
my research, not even my mother.

17:15.510 --> 17:20.810
I resented my mother for bringing me into this world.

17:20.810 --> 17:25.060
But deep down, I longed for recognition.

17:25.060 --> 17:30.020
Did you start this research to
figure out your mother's heart?

17:30.020 --> 17:31.530
I've already forgotten.

17:32.360 --> 17:34.610
Because my mother is dead.

17:35.280 --> 17:40.740
I wonder if your heart is always empty because of your mother.

17:42.660 --> 17:45.210
Why is it a key?

17:47.500 --> 17:50.540
I didn't put much thought into buying it.

17:50.540 --> 17:54.130
For now, it's your key to the future.

17:54.720 --> 17:56.130
The future?

17:56.130 --> 17:59.260
Yeah, I'll make sure open that door for you.

17:59.260 --> 18:01.390
The door to the future you yearn for.

18:01.810 --> 18:03.520
I believe in you.

18:03.520 --> 18:05.480
I'll give you that when the time comes.

18:06.270 --> 18:07.730
Wear it when I do.

18:12.520 --> 18:14.650
Oh, right! The filter!

18:14.650 --> 18:20.070
If I get rid of this thing, I can hear your voice again, Mimei!

18:27.000 --> 18:29.290
Stop this cruelty!

18:29.710 --> 18:33.090
Thanks to you, my research has taken a giant leap forward!

18:33.090 --> 18:36.090
Come on, praise me! Well, come on!

18:36.670 --> 18:39.260
Mimei! You're a sinner too!

18:39.260 --> 18:41.890
Leave this island with that man!

18:42.300 --> 18:45.310
Mimei... Mimei... Mimei... Mimei...

18:45.310 --> 18:45.680
Mi...

18:51.230 --> 18:53.650
I'm inside the Lightless Realm?

18:53.650 --> 18:55.650
When was I swallowed in?

19:01.570 --> 19:04.450
I can't afford to die in a place like this yet.

19:07.080 --> 19:09.040
It's stuck?

19:09.790 --> 19:12.290
It's my keepsake of Mimei, but I have no choice.

19:14.130 --> 19:15.460
It won't come off?

19:15.460 --> 19:18.340
What the hell's wrong with this?

19:18.340 --> 19:21.180
Dammit, get off!

19:24.390 --> 19:25.260
My candy!

19:25.260 --> 19:27.720
Dammit! My candy!

19:28.180 --> 19:29.680
Dammit!

19:31.140 --> 19:32.690
Can't forgive them...

19:37.860 --> 19:40.860
Stay away! Stay away from me!

19:41.150 --> 19:42.570
Wh-What do you want?

19:42.570 --> 19:45.830
I'll have Mimei praise me more and more!

19:48.700 --> 19:49.500
Mimei?

19:51.460 --> 19:54.000
Mimei, you came for me.

19:54.000 --> 19:56.210
Help me! These guys are nuts!

19:58.510 --> 19:59.920
Unforgivable!

20:00.340 --> 20:01.220
Mimei?

20:09.430 --> 20:11.140
Mimei! Mimei!

20:16.820 --> 20:18.690
What's wrong?

20:18.690 --> 20:21.700
Natsuiri just died...

20:21.700 --> 20:22.650
What?

20:22.650 --> 20:23.660
You're sure?

20:23.660 --> 20:25.120
Yes.

20:25.120 --> 20:27.870
The voice of Natsuiri himself leaked through.

20:34.790 --> 20:35.830
That's...

20:36.500 --> 20:38.340
The place where the lab was.

20:40.380 --> 20:41.470
Big Sister...

20:42.840 --> 20:47.970
But I hope this can lessen the
regrets of the people of the island.

20:47.970 --> 20:49.100
It won't.

20:50.390 --> 20:54.600
Even if you get revenge, the grudge won't go away.

20:54.600 --> 20:57.650
You just lose the outlet for your feelings and suffer.

20:58.520 --> 21:01.230
You can't avenge a grudge.

21:01.230 --> 21:04.530
We were mistaken from the beginning.

21:07.240 --> 21:08.450
Let's go.

21:12.750 --> 21:15.210
The island's port is this way.

21:15.790 --> 21:17.670
Thanks, Minashi.

21:18.920 --> 21:21.630
As I thought, a working ship is...

21:21.630 --> 21:23.340
Suzaki-san, over there!

21:23.340 --> 21:24.840
A cruiser!

21:24.840 --> 21:28.090
I see, so that's the ship Natsuiri came here on.

21:28.090 --> 21:29.180
Let's hurry!

21:40.940 --> 21:42.780
It's being swallowed up...

21:42.780 --> 21:43.740
Into the darkness.

21:47.030 --> 21:49.160
What should we do now, Akashi?

21:50.080 --> 21:54.500
Whether or not we should stay with IX from here on.

21:54.500 --> 21:55.750
It's too horrible.

21:55.750 --> 21:59.330
Everything that Natsuiri and the other members at IX did.

21:59.330 --> 22:04.340
But there's nothing we can do if we leave IX.

22:04.340 --> 22:06.130
Well, that's true.

22:06.130 --> 22:09.260
Besides, there are people we can believe in.

22:10.050 --> 22:12.100
And people we want to believe in us.

22:13.100 --> 22:16.890
I don't know what I can do now, but I don't want to step down.

22:18.560 --> 22:20.020
We'll take care of things.

22:20.020 --> 22:24.320
If we end it, I'm sure that once again...

22:32.160 --> 22:34.700
Aoshi...

22:56.430 --> 23:00.480
You lose your mind, you crash; a nervous breakdown

23:00.480 --> 23:05.230
You feel an urge inside, you crush; there's no escape now

23:05.230 --> 23:10.110
You try to change your life, you jump another let down

23:10.110 --> 23:12.700
But then you hear a voice inside

23:12.700 --> 23:15.990
You gotta open up your vision and see the life bestowed on you

23:15.990 --> 23:18.580
Blinded by reality

23:18.580 --> 23:20.750
Broken ideology

23:20.750 --> 23:23.290
Heart in captivity

23:23.290 --> 23:25.630
Hold on, exceeding the borders within

23:25.630 --> 23:28.130
Seize your capability

23:28.130 --> 23:30.510
Endless possibility

23:30.510 --> 23:32.840
Find your individuality

23:32.930 --> 23:35.060
Take pride; let the chase begin

23:35.060 --> 23:37.720
Don't tell me what direction you think I should take

23:37.720 --> 23:39.520
I know now to find the way

23:39.520 --> 23:42.520
Don’t tell me that this sable is for my own sake

23:42.520 --> 23:44.060
Here's what I’ve got to say

23:44.060 --> 23:47.320
Don't tell me to believe the decisions you make

23:47.320 --> 23:49.530
Facing a new day

23:49.530 --> 23:51.530
So open up your blinded eyes

23:51.530 --> 23:54.530
Stop living a lie and start living your life

23:54.530 --> 23:56.870
My way or no way

23:56.870 --> 23:59.330
Today you’re falling away

23:59.330 --> 24:01.670
My way or no way

24:01.670 --> 24:04.960
Today I’m breaking away

24:05.040 --> 24:10.050
Episode 20

24:05.040 --> 24:10.050
Overlapping Sound of Love
